  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In an aerial clash with seven Tie clansmen, Fang Yuan dodges most strikes on bone wings and takes the rest on golden shield Gu light. The Tie clan fighters in that clash measure that control against Southern Border flying experts, including Hong Fei Yu.",
      "chapters": [
        361
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_tie_clan",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes her appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s famous flying Gu Masters include Fei You Wang, Lan Mei He, and Hong Fei Yu. They are feared, battling them is extremely troublesome, and no one wishes to make an enemy of them.",
      "chapters": [
        364
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "famous-flying-masters",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_fei_you_wang",
        "char_lan_mei_he"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang ascend and join Yi Tian Village as famous flying masters. The righteous path invites Hong Fei Yu, a female flying master of the righteous path, to resist them. Alone she cannot match the two demonic path flying masters. She is between life and death when Shang clan reinforcement Wei Yang arrives, saves her, and then stalls both after she is heavily injured and retreats, until more righteous reinforcements force them back. After the battle Wei Yang joins the flying masters’ ranks; Southern Border’s three famous flying masters become four, with Wei Yang at the top.",
      "chapters": [
        965
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "loc_yi_tian_village",
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "char_wei_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the righteous path side, Wei Yang and Hong Fei Yu later ally and gain an advantage over Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang in aerial battles.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-yang-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
